From d99430f39a6bdbfad2fd88fcd60ea95225b5caf4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christoph Wolk <cwo.kde@posteo.net>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:06:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applets/kicker, applets/kickoff: use DashboardModel

Application Dashboard opened on Recent Applications only, so recent
documents were only reachable through search or their own category. Add a
Dashboard start view with favorites, recent apps, files and folders.

BUG: 360389
